<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for QuickShot's real-identity signing path
  (scripts/package.sh with SIGN_IDENTITY != "-").

  QuickShot is a plain Rust binary: no JIT, no dynamically loaded third-party
  dylibs (system frameworks are Apple-signed; Rust deps are statically linked),
  so it needs no relaxations — an empty entitlement set is correct and keeps the
  signature notarization-ready. Add keys here only if a future feature requires
  them. Screen Recording is a TCC permission granted at runtime, NOT an
  entitlement, so it does not belong in this file.
-->
